{
  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "Use Java 17+ as required by Spring Framework 6.0.",
    "For U4, the execution context decoupling fix will be formally applied in Spring Batch core, and XD will upgrade its Spring Batch dependency to inherit the fix.",
    "For U5, Java Config will be used instead of XML configurations for custom job modules to resolve deployment and launch errors.",
    "For U6, a pluggable Service Provider Interface (SPI) will be designed to decouple XD from specific container implementations like Lattice/Diego.",
    "For U8, the XD shell processor will be extended to interact with a Python runtime to execute scripts hosted on HDFS."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "The developer has full access to the necessary repositories, CI/CD pipelines, and deployment environments.",
    "Hadoop and HDFS environments are already set up and accessible for testing U2, U3, and U8.",
    "The XD-on-Lattice/Diego PoC environment is available for testing U6.",
    "Testing, debugging, and integration efforts are included within each activity's estimate.",
    "Module documentation updates (U7) will be applied across all existing modules."
  ],
  "activities": [
    {
      "activity_id": "A1",
      "activity_name": "Wiki Migration to Project Repo",
      "activity_description": "Migrate the wiki to the project repository so that it can be tagged with the code and versioned.",
      "most_likely_effort": 1.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A2",
      "activity_name": "Hadoop Namenode Configuration",
      "activity_description": "Add Hadoop namenode specifics in a config file to automatically configure DSL sessions without manual pointing.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A3",
      "activity_name": "Jdbchdfs Passthrough Batch Job",
      "activity_description": "Implement a jdbchdfs batch job as a passthrough without chunk processing to avoid batch read/write overhead.",
      "most_likely_effort": 3.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A4",
      "activity_name": "Spring Batch Execution Context Decoupling & XD Upgrade",
      "activity_description": "Decouple execution context from job launch lifecycle in Spring Batch, upgrade XD to the new Batch release, and refactor the XD-2486 workaround.",
      "most_likely_effort": 6.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A5",
      "activity_name": "Custom Job Module Java Config & Deployment Fix",
      "activity_description": "Create a custom job module using Java Config instead of XML, and fix the deployment/launch error where the job is not found.",
      "most_likely_effort": 3.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A6",
      "activity_name": "Pluggable SPI Design for XD-on-Lattice/Diego",
      "activity_description": "Continue the XD-on-Lattice/Diego PoC by designing a pluggable SPI to make it generally applicable, with the Receptor API as one implementation option.",
      "most_likely_effort": 5.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A7",
      "activity_name": "Module Documentation Update",
      "activity_description": "Update all module docs to include a shortDescription so users can learn more about the module.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A8",
      "activity_name": "Python Script Execution from HDFS via XD Shell Processor",
      "activity_description": "Host/read Python script files from HDFS and use the shell processor in XD (on CF) to delegate data science functionality to the Python runtime and receive feedback.",
      "most_likely_effort": 4.5
    }
  ],
  "reported_total": {
    "most_likely_effort": 28.0
  }
}
```

